\title{Protocol Snarkification}
\author{dhsorens}
\meta{toc}{true}
\date{2025-12-18}

\p{
    There are ongoing efforts to "snarkify" Ethereum, i.e. to integrate [zero knowledge proofs](dhsorens-001L) into every layer of the Ethereum protocol. I contribute to this via [formal verification](dhsorens-000X) in [Lean](dhsorens-lean). My main focus is currently on [CompPoly](dhsorens-comppoly) and [Arklib](https://github.com/Verified-zkEVM/ArkLib).
}

\p{
    See [our website](http://verified-zkevm.org) for more information.
}

